{{!
    @template theme_brandable/connect_disclosure

    What the site sends to Brandable, and its terms and privacy policy: shown before the connection (connection page
    and editor).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * termsurl - Terms of Brandable, in the language of the user
    * privacyurl - Privacy policy of Brandable, in the language of the user

    Example context (json):
    {
        "termsurl": "https://brandablelms.com/en/terms",
        "privacyurl": "https://brandablelms.com/en/privacy"
    }
}}
<div class="tbe-disclosure">
    <p class="tbe-disclosure-title">{{#str}} connect:sent, theme_brandable {{/str}}</p>
    <ul>
        <li>{{#str}} connect:sentconnection, theme_brandable {{/str}}</li>
        <li>{{#str}} connect:sentprompt, theme_brandable {{/str}}</li>
        <li>{{#str}} connect:sentcloud, theme_brandable {{/str}}</li>
        <li>{{#str}} connect:sentonly, theme_brandable {{/str}}</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mb-0">
        {{#str}} connect:accept, theme_brandable {{/str}}
        <a href="{{termsurl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{#str}} connect:terms, theme_brandable {{/str}}</a>
        ·
        <a href="{{privacyurl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{#str}} connect:privacy, theme_brandable {{/str}}</a>
    </p>
</div>
